id: pm-slack-1aeu
title: Fix release publish ordering before protected main push
description: "The daily release workflow published to npm before pushing the version bump to protected main. The push was rejected with GH006 and set -e killed the job before the tag push, leaving npm ahead of git. Port the protected-PR merge ordering from pm-beads PR 65 so main contains the release commit before npm publish runs."
